---
description: TypeScript and code quality conventions for Tablevera mobile
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Code style

- TypeScript **strict**
- Double quotes, 2-space indent, semicolons
- Prefer named exports for components
- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*`
- Keep files focused; split when a component + helpers exceeds ~200 lines
- No `any` unless interfacing with untyped native APIs (narrow ASAP)
- Prefer `function` declarations for components
- Do not import from `@reservations/ui` (web/antd) — mobile has its own kit
